..!interpreter english translate noabbrev
..*****************************************************************************
.. FOP-Name       : ABRUFZENTRALE.TAB.LIEFERUNGEN
.. Autor          : mh
.. Verantwortlich : mh
.. Kontrolle      :
.. Funktion       :
.. Functionality  : Find on-the-way delivieres for a customer/product
..*****************************************************************************
.set trans -
..
.. Only read delivery notes one time
.continue END ? M|tbligelesen
.copy M|tbligelesen = G|true
..
.type GD    xnabdat
..
.formula M|tlimge1  = 0.0
.formula M|tlimge2  = 0.0
.formula M|tlimge3  = 0.0
.formula M|tlimge4  = 0.0
.formula M|tlimge5  = 0.0
.formula M|tlimge6  = 0.0
.formula M|tlimge7  = 0.0
